    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In a factory that resides within a devastated world, you must take control and start re-building civilization. Discover new technologies and old history while exploring. Harvest and utilize natural resources to craft, build and automate your production lines. Develop new technologies allowing you to start re-building the war-torn landscape of the world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post-apocalyptic top down sandbox game where you can shape the world to your own desire!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining and destruction:</strong>\u00a0Mine and demolish to your hearts content. Use the pickaxe to speed this up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect Your automation:</strong> Progressive factory setups allow you to add, remove, and replace components of production lines with ease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master your world:</strong> With a rich list of achievements to chase, you will never run out of tasks to complete in your factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revitalization:</strong> Discover exciting technologies that can help on your quest towards a re-built society</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Collaborate and relax with friends over LAN or IP</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In a factory that resides within a devastated world, you must take control and start re-building civilization. Discover new technologies and old history while exploring. Harvest and utilize natural resources to craft, build and automate your production lines. Develop new technologies allowing you to start re-building the war-torn landscape of the world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post-apocalyptic top down sandbox game where you can shape the world to your own desire!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining and destruction:</strong>\u00a0Mine and demolish to your hearts content. Use the pickaxe to speed this up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect Your automation:</strong> Progressive factory setups allow you to add, remove, and replace components of production lines with ease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master your world:</strong> With a rich list of achievements to chase, you will never run out of tasks to complete in your factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revitalization:</strong> Discover exciting technologies that can help on your quest towards a re-built society</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Collaborate and relax with friends over LAN or IP</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Harvest natural resources and build machines to rebuild society following a terrible war that left the world scarred.",
